<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>极简博客</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/font-awesome@4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            primary: '#165DFF',
            secondary: '#7B61FF',
            accent: '#FF7D00',
            dark: '#1D2129',
            light: '#F2F3F5'
          },
          fontFamily: {
            inter: ['Inter', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],
          },
        },
      }
    }
  </script>
</head>
<body class="font-inter bg-light text-dark">
  <header class="bg-white shadow-sm sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex justify-between items-center">
      <a href="#" class="text-primary font-bold text-xl">极简博客</a>
      <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-6">
        <a href="#" class="text-dark hover:text-primary transition-colors">首页</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-dark hover:text-primary transition-colors">文章</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-dark hover:text-primary transition-colors">关于</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-dark hover:text-primary transition-colors">联系</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="md:hidden text-dark text-xl">
        <i class="fa fa-bars"></i>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <section class="mb-12">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary rounded-lg p-8 text-white">
        <h1 class="text-[clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.5rem)] font-bold mb-4">探索前端开发的无限可能</h1>
        <p class="text-lg mb-6 max-w-2xl">分享最新的前端技术、框架和开发经验，帮助你打造令人惊叹的Web体验。</p>
        <a href="#" class="inline-block bg-white text-primary px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-light transition-colors">
          查看文章
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
      <article class="bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/article1/600/400" alt="前端开发文章配图" class="w-full h-48 object-cover">
        <div class="p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Tailwind CSS 3新特性解析</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">深入了解Tailwind CSS 3带来的全新特性和性能优化，提升你的CSS工作流。</p>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">2025-06-10</span>
            <a href="#" class="text-primary hover:text-secondary transition-colors">阅读更多</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/article2/600/400" alt="响应式设计文章配图" class="w-full h-48 object-cover">
        <div class="p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">现代响应式设计最佳实践</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">学习如何创建适应各种设备的响应式网站，提供一致的用户体验。</p>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">2025-06-05</span>
            <a href="#" class="text-primary hover:text-secondary transition-colors">阅读更多</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">订阅获取最新更新</h2>
      <form class="max-w-md mx-auto flex">
        <input type="email" placeholder="输入你的邮箱地址" class="flex-grow px-4 py-2 rounded-l-lg border-2 border-primary focus:outline-none">
        <button type="submit" class="bg-primary text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-r-lg hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors">
          订阅
        </button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="bg-dark text-white py-8">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center">
        <div class="mb-6 md:mb-0">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">极简博客</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400">分享前端开发的点滴心得</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex space-x-4">
          <a href="#" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <i class="fa fa-github text-xl"></i>
          </a>
          <a href="#" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <i class="fa fa-twitter text-xl"></i>
          </a>
          <a href="#" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <i class="fa fa-linkedin text-xl"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-gray-800 mt-6 pt-6 text-center text-gray-500">
        <p>&copy; 2025 极简博客. 保留所有权利.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
    
